Steps to Use the Multiple Product Request Feature
Step 1 – Open the application
Go to the application URL. Inside Topics, click on Multiple product request.
Step 2 – Open the download template card
On the right side of the screen, locate the Download Template card and click the Download file option.
Step 3 – Choose a template type
You will see two options:

Default template – All columns are pre-selected by default.
Custom template – You can choose which columns you need.

Select the option that suits your requirement.
Step 4 – Download the template
Click Download template. An Excel file will be downloaded to your device.
Step 5 – Fill in the Product name column
Open the downloaded file. In the Product name column, enter one of the following: Sales name, SP number, or OPN. Fill in this column only — do not edit any other column. Save the file once done.
Step 6 – Upload the filled template
Go back to the application and upload the saved file using the File upload option.
Step 7 – Preview the uploaded data
A preview of the uploaded data will appear on screen. Review it, then click Continue to AI-filling.
Step 8 – Run AI-filling
Click AI-filling. The AI will automatically populate all remaining information.
Step 9 – Review the AI results
A preview of the filled data will be shown on screen. Review it, then click Continue to Export.
Step 10 – Download the final report
Click Download xlsx to download the completed report in Excel format.


This guide walks you through the Multiple Product Request feature in the application. This feature allows you to request information for multiple products at once by using a downloadable Excel template.
Instead of entering product details one by one, you can simply download the template, fill in the product names, and upload it back to the application. The built-in AI will then automatically fill in all the remaining product information for you.
By the end of this guide, you will be able to:

Download and fill the product request template
Upload it to the application
Use the AI-filling feature to auto-populate product details
Export and download the final report in Excel format

This process is designed to save time and reduce manual effort, making it easier to handle large volumes of product data efficiently.
